# Dynamic Crane Simulation & ODE Integration (Experiment LTD)

This module models and simulates the nonlinear motion of a crane boom carrying a swinging payload under damping and external forces. The system is solved using MATLAB ODE solvers (`ode45` and `ode23`) to analyze motion trajectories, dynamic rod forces, and bending stresses across the beam.

